Debug mode on a directory walks every level of nesting, printing files down to `level1/level2/level3/d.md` in path order with a blank line between files.
== args
--debug
input/deep
== file input/deep/a.md
# a
== file input/deep/level1/b.md
# b
== file input/deep/level1/level2/c.md
# c
== file input/deep/level1/level2/level3/d.md
# d
== stdout
«# a»

«# b»

«# c»

«# d»
== stderr
== exit 0
